{"id":63532,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63532"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:49:31","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:49:31","slug":"trail-terra-do-sol","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-terra-do-sol\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Terra do Sol 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Terra do Sol 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Terra do Sol 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), na freguesia da <strong>Amareleja<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Moura<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Beja<\/strong>. Com centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es sediado no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos das Cancelinhas, o evento conduz os atletas por magn\u00edficos trilhos, caminhos rurais, vias de terra batida e ribeiras circundantes da raia alentejana.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo apresenta quatro op\u00e7\u00f5es \u00e0 medida de cada participante: o exigente <strong>Trail Longo de 32 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 08:15 na ponte romana do Rio Ardila com transporte assegurado pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s 07:30 a partir de Amareleja), o r\u00e1pido <strong>Trail Sprint de 18 km<\/strong> (09:15), o acess\u00edvel <strong>Mini Trail de 10 km<\/strong> (09:30) e a tradicional <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (09:30). Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio e bebidas ap\u00f3s a prova.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o pertence \u00e0 <strong>Sociedade Filarm\u00f3nica Uni\u00e3o Musical Amarelejense (S.F.U.M.A.)<\/strong>, contando com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Moura<\/strong> e da <strong>Junta de Freguesia da Amareleja<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class