font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra o Trail Longo 32 km \u00e0s 08:15 (com partida na ponte romana do Rio Ardila e transporte \u00e0s 07:30 da Amareleja), o Trail Sprint 18 km \u00e0s 09:15, e o Mini Trail 10 km e a Caminhada 10 km \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O almo\u00e7o est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es nas dist\u00e2ncias competitivas e na caminhada incluem o almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio e bebidas servidos ap\u00f3s a prova. Acompanhantes podem adquirir almo\u00e7o por 10,00 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento de dorsais decorre no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos das Cancelinhas no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, 15 de novembro, entre as 06:30 e as 08:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial completo encontra-se publicado na plataforma Acorrer atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o: https:\/\/assets.acorrer.pt\/media\/9876\/6a8c597b11b94_regulamento.pdf.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Terra do Sol 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Amareleja (Moura, Beja)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Beja)\", \"addressRegion\": \"Beja\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Terra do Sol 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com secretariado e centro nevr\u00e1lgico no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos das Cancelinhas, na Amareleja, concelho de Moura, distrito de Beja.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra o Trail Longo 32 km \u00e0s 08:15 (com partida na ponte romana do Rio Ardila e transporte \u00e0s 07:30 da Amareleja), o Trail Sprint 18 km \u00e0s 09:15, e o Mini Trail 10 km e a Caminhada 10 km \u00e0s 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O almo\u00e7o est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es nas dist\u00e2ncias competitivas e na caminhada incluem o almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio e bebidas servidos ap\u00f3s a prova. Acompanhantes podem adquirir almo\u00e7o por 10,00 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando podem ser levantados os dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento de dorsais decorre no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos das Cancelinhas no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, 15 de novembro, entre as 06:30 e as 08:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial completo encontra-se publicado na plataforma Acorrer atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o: https:\/\/assets.acorrer.pt\/media\/9876\/6a8c597b11b94_regulamento.pdf.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68997,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[728,44,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63532","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-moura-beja","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-beja","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-trail-terra-do-sol.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63532","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collecti